/P 228 0 R
/E (For this assignment, I designed a decorative lighting fixture inspired by a royal crown and chandelier elements. I first created the main structure and individual details in Rhino, including the circular crown-shaped body, twisted central support, hanging crystal-like pieces, decorative patterns, and circular base. I focused on combining curved forms, geometric shapes, and ornamental details to give the fixture an elegant and luxurious appearance. After completing the 3D model, I imported it into KeyShot and applied different materials, including gold metal, bronze accents, and transparent glass-like materials. I then adjusted the lighting, reflections, shadows, and studio background to make the materials and details more visible. Finally, I rendered the model in KeyShot to create a realistic presentation of my lighting fixture.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
