/Title (I first attempted to create the mouse using surface modeling, but I found it difficult to create the correct outline and build the form from curves. I tried multiple times to develop the outline and use 2-Point Curves, but I was not able to achieve the shape I wanted. After approximately 20 attempts, I decided to use the Loft command as an alternative approach. This allowed me to create the overall mouse form more successfully while still exploring how different curves can control a 3D surface.)
